### Lista rezerwacji
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations

### Nowa rezerwacja
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Nowak",
  "email": "anna.nowak@example.com",
  "phone": "600700800",
  "checkIn": "2026-11-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-11-13"
}

### Ta sama rezerwacja drugi raz -> 409 (pokój zajęty)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Nowak",
  "email": "anna.nowak@example.com",
  "checkIn": "2026-11-11",
  "checkOut": "2026-11-12"
}

### Zameldowanie
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/2/check-in

### Wymeldowanie
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/2/check-out

### Anulowanie
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1/cancel

### Wolne pokoje z cenami z .NET (pt–pon)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/available?from=2026-11-06&to=2026-11-09

### Rezerwacja na weekend (cena z .NET, zgłoszona do .NET)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 4,
  "firstName": "Piotr",
  "lastName": "Wiśniewski",
  "email": "piotr.w@example.com",
  "checkIn": "2026-11-06",
  "checkOut": "2026-11-09"
}

### Raport dzienny (Spring + .NET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reports/daily?date=2026-11-07
